* ============================================================================
* 21_substance_clarity_robustness.do — v3.5.1 A1 词汇清晰度稳健性 (lexical clarity; P3 Table A7)
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
* 锚定: Loughran & McDonald (2011, JF 66:1) uncertain 词典 (不确定性词表);
*         You et al. (2018) hhx055 Panel C/D 中文改编;
*         真双轨 (full + ctx 独立扫描, 修 R3-C1).
*
* Plan: stage3_v3_5_1_a1_a3_supplementation_plan.md §2.5 (per R6-C1 schema 扩 tA7).
* 三角化: Panel C 将 A1 与 ln_fintech_mdna_length (P2 mediator) 联合, 修 §2.5.3.
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off
set maxvar 32767
set linesize 120

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear

set seed {{RANDOM_SEED}}

* Panel A: 主 DV 对双轨 clarity 回归 (full + ctx 独立扫描)
* 两列由 encode_collab 同源无条件共产 (encode_collab.py:732-733), 故 _full 在则 _ctx 必在; 一并 confirm 保证守卫字面覆盖所用回归量。
capture confirm variable mean_clarity_score_full mean_clarity_score_ctx
if !_rc {
    reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} mean_clarity_score_full mean_clarity_score_ctx $bank_controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id year)
    eststo subst_clarity_main
}
else {
    display "  [WARN] mean_clarity_score_full not in panel (v3.5.1 D5 enrichment pending)"
}

* Panel B: clarity_full × substantiveness 交互 (construct-separability 构念可分性检验)
* 白话: 这里跑的是清晰度与实质性的交互回归, 检查两构念是否可区分; HTMT 比率本身不在本 do-file 计算,
*       而是由 stage 39d 产出后填入下方 display 行 (见 line 64-66), 此回归只是其旁证。
capture confirm variable mean_clarity_score_full
if !_rc {
    reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} c.mean_clarity_score_full##c.{{MAIN_TREAT}} $bank_controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id year)
    eststo subst_clarity_interact
}

* Panel C: 三角化 (A1 clarity + ln_fintech_mdna_length, 修 §2.5.3)
capture confirm variable ln_fintech_mdna_length
if !_rc {
    reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} mean_clarity_score_full ln_fintech_mdna_length {{MAIN_TREAT}} $bank_controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id year)
    eststo subst_clarity_triangulate
}

* Panel D: frac_amb_articles 二值化版 (binarize at D0 median, 修 R9-M3 备份)
capture confirm variable frac_amb_articles_full
if !_rc {
    reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} frac_amb_articles_full $bank_controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id year)
    eststo subst_clarity_binary
}

* HTMT diagnostic (stage 39d 运行时填充, 修 R9-H3 seed=42).
* Replication 包用户应先跑 stage 39d 生成 data/processed/39d_htmt_matrix.json,
* 然后人工填入 local; 或 batch 模式由 stata_runner pre-render 注入.
local htmt_subst_clarity = "<run 39d first>"
display "v3.5.1 39d HTMT(substance, clarity) = `htmt_subst_clarity'"
display "  双 cutoff: strict < 0.85 / lenient < 0.90 (修 R4-M2)"

* 输出
esttab subst_clarity_main subst_clarity_interact subst_clarity_triangulate subst_clarity_binary ///
    using "$tables_dir/tableA7_clarity_robustness.tex", ///
    se star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) replace ///
    title("Table A7: Lexical Clarity Robustness (LM 2011 JF; You 2018) — {{PAPER_ID}}") ///
    note("Dual-track independent dictionary scan over content_full and content_ctx.")
